    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A classic drama is reborn in anime style!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into an interactive reimagining of popular Taiwanese soap opera THE BONFIRE of TAIWAN, fully licensed and ready to set the stage for a new generation of fans! Re:Burn The Bonfire of Taiwan puts you in control of the narrative, allowing you to guide the beloved characters to endings from the original show, complete with unlockable live action clips of iconic scenes, or make choices that lead to unique game-exclusive outcomes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each chapter, you can choose to play from multiple perspectives and navigate the city map. Confront \u201cboss\u201d characters through direct combat or a war of words, use items like DNA test results and divorce agreements to state your case, rely on other characters\u2019 unique support skills, leverage property deeds and more as the conflict between rival families heats up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, romance is a key element in any great drama, so manage your relationships carefully, going on dates and making key decisions to get characters together or break them up! The choice is yours, and with cleared chapters available to try again any time, there\u2019s loads of possibilities waiting to be explored!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy anime aesthetics and a huge cast of memorable characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the drama with key decisions as the narrative unfolds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select various characters to view chapters from different perspectives!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your allies\u2019 support skills when it\u2019s time to confront rival bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop romantic relationships as you see fit by going on dates or visiting the Love Temple!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764290/extras/83fe333a14a01600807abd340a59f973.avif?t=1753290281\" width=616 height=1420 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A classic drama is reborn in anime style!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into an interactive reimagining of popular Taiwanese soap opera THE BONFIRE of TAIWAN, fully licensed and ready to set the stage for a new generation of fans! Re:Burn The Bonfire of Taiwan puts you in control of the narrative, allowing you to guide the beloved characters to endings from the original show, complete with unlockable live action clips of iconic scenes, or make choices that lead to unique game-exclusive outcomes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each chapter, you can choose to play from multiple perspectives and navigate the city map. Confront \u201cboss\u201d characters through direct combat or a war of words, use items like DNA test results and divorce agreements to state your case, rely on other characters\u2019 unique support skills, leverage property deeds and more as the conflict between rival families heats up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, romance is a key element in any great drama, so manage your relationships carefully, going on dates and making key decisions to get characters together or break them up! The choice is yours, and with cleared chapters available to try again any time, there\u2019s loads of possibilities waiting to be explored!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy anime aesthetics and a huge cast of memorable characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the drama with key decisions as the narrative unfolds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select various characters to view chapters from different perspectives!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your allies\u2019 support skills when it\u2019s time to confront rival bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop romantic relationships as you see fit by going on dates or visiting the Love Temple!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764290/extras/83fe333a14a01600807abd340a59f973.avif?t=1753290281\" width=616 height=1420 /></span></p>",
